doi: 10.5281/zenodo.18343663
abstract: >-
  ClinVar-GKM is a data transformation pipeline that
  converts ClinVar release data into the GA4GH GKM (Genomic
  Knowledge Model) schema set: VRS, Cat-VRS and VA-Spec. It is
  developed and maintained by the ClinGen driver project. The
  underlying data come from NCBI's ClinVar; please also cite
  ClinVar (see references).
